 rose:'<path d="M60 26c12-9 24 3 19 15 16-3 22 13 11 23 10 12 0 25-14 20-3 17-21 18-27 3-15 7-27-6-18-19-15-7-12-24 4-26-2-15 14-24 25-16Z"/><path d="M60 44c13-7 25 8 15 18 4 13-12 22-21 11-14 2-18-15-7-22 1-5 7-9 13-7Z"/><circle cx="60" cy="60" r="7"/>',
